  "equipment_type": "VRF BACnet IP gateway (up to 8 or 64 indoor units)",
  "applies_to": "Hitachi air conditioning and VRF indoor units on H-Link, reached through a Hitachi HC-A8MB or HC-A64MB communication adaptor.",
  "summary": "An older IntesisBox BACnet IP server that polls one Hitachi HC-A8MB or HC-A64MB adaptor and publishes each indoor unit as a fixed block of 33 objects. HI-AC-BAC-8 handles up to 8 indoor units and HI-AC-BAC-64 up to 64. Instances are (unit number x 100) + offset, so unit 1 uses 101-133. Setup is done with the LinkBoxBACnet tool.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet IP"
  ],
  "firmware": "4.0.0 (PICS 2016-11-10)",
  "default_device_instance": 246,
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "Indoor unit objects are shown for unit 1 only. Instance = (xxx x 100) + offset, xxx = indoor unit number 1-64. Object names start with IUxxx, replaced by the unit number on site.",
    "This is the older product that talks to Hitachi's HC-A8MB/HC-A64MB adaptor. The newer Intesis INBACHIT016O000/064O000 (also sold as HI-AC-BAC-16/64) connects straight to H-Link and uses a different object set.",
    "Names follow the member-objects table, except Inlet/OutletTemperature, where the section headings and detail pages agree without the underscore. Some detail pages print other variants (IUxxx_CentralSet_OnOff_command, IUxxx_RCSwitch_Configuration_Ma, IUxxx_Settempstatus); check the live object names.",
    "The doc gives temperature ranges in °C but sets the Units property to no-units.",
    "The setpoint command AO's property table marks Present_Value R; it is listed here as writable because it is the setpoint command. Louver state texts (8 states) are not printed.",
    "Error and compressor stop cause codes are Hitachi codes; 255 means off."
  ],
  "source": {
    "title": "IntesisBox BACnet/IP - Hitachi AC User Manual r1.1",
    "doc_number": null,
    "revision_date": "r1.1 (PICS 2016-11-10)",
    "url": "https://cdn.chipkin.com/assets/uploads/2018/feb/01-01-25-53_intesisbox_hi-ac-bac-8-64_user_manual_en.pdf",
    "unofficial": true,
    "host": "Chipkin Automation Systems"
  },
  "integration": {
    "summary": "Connect the IntesisBox to the HC-A8MB/HC-A64MB adaptor and the BACnet IP LAN, set the IP and number of indoor units in LinkBoxBACnet, then map each unit's _command and _status objects from its (unit x 100) block.",
    "minimum_points": [
      {
        "ref": "BO 105",
        "name": "IUxxx_OnOff_command",
        "why": "Start/stop indoor unit"
      },
      {
        "ref": "MO 107",
        "name": "IUxxx_Mode_command",
        "why": "Mode command"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AO 111",
        "name": "IUxxx_Settemp_command",
        "why": "Setpoint command, 17-30 °C"
      },
      {
        "ref": "MO 109",
        "name": "IUxxx_Fan_command",
        "why": "Fan speed command (5 = auto)"
      },
      {
        "ref": "BI 104",
        "name": "IUxxx_OnOff_status",
        "why": "Run status"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 110",
        "name": "IUxxx_Settemp_status",
        "why": "Setpoint in use"
      },
      {
        "ref": "AI 119",
        "name": "IUxxx_InletTemperature",
        "why": "Return air temperature"
      },
      {
        "ref": "BI 101",
        "name": "IUxxx_IU_Exist",
        "why": "Unit found on the adaptor"
      },
      {
        "ref": "MI 123",
        "name": "IUxxx_ErrorCode",
        "why": "Alarm code (255 = off)"
      },
      {
        "ref": "BI 0",
        "name": "Communication error Hitachi GW",
        "why": "Adaptor communication lost"
      }
    ],
    "enable": "No enable point is documented. Remote-controller permissions can be locked per unit with the CentralSet BVs (BV 114-118).",
    "heartbeat": null,
    "remote_sensors": null,
    "setup": [
      "Default device instance 246; device instance, name and IP are set with LinkBoxBACnet.",
      "One IntesisBox integrates one HC-A8MB or HC-A64MB adaptor (bought separately from Hitachi).",
      "The number of indoor units is set in LinkBoxBACnet; HI-AC-BAC-8 supports 8 units, HI-AC-BAC-64 supports 64."
    ],
    "gotchas": [
      "Outputs only use Priority_Array slot 16; slots 1-15 stay NULL.",
      "State_Text cannot be read as a whole array; read one array index at a time.",
      "Temperatures are °C but the Units property is no-units."
    ]
  },
